{
  "duration": 243,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "crawl_00",
      "scene": "crawl",
      "t": 1.2,
      "localT": 1.2,
      "text": "A long time ago, in a galaxy far, far away…",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "file": "vo/crawl_00.mp3",
      "dur": 3.73551
    },
    {
      "id": "crawl_01",
      "scene": "crawl",
      "t": 10.5,
      "localT": 10.5,
      "text": "It is a time of rebellion.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/crawl_01.mp3",
      "dur": 1.802449
    },
    {
      "id": "crawl_02",
      "scene": "crawl",
      "t": 14,
      "localT": 14,
      "text": "Imperial fleets patrol every hyperlane, and the last free worlds are running out of places to hide.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/crawl_02.mp3",
      "dur": 7.262041
    },
    {
      "id": "crawl_03",
      "scene": "crawl",
      "t": 22,
      "localT": 22,
      "text": "Aboard a stolen corvette, a rebel princess carries the plans to the Empire’s armoured moon: a fortress with power enough to shatter a planet.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/crawl_03.mp3",
      "dur": 9.16898
    },
    {
      "id": "crawl_04",
      "scene": "crawl",
      "t": 32.5,
      "localT": 32.5,
      "text": "Pursued by the flagship of the dark lord, she runs for home, hunted across the stars.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/crawl_04.mp3",
      "dur": 5.825306
    },
    {
      "id": "chase_00",
      "scene": "chase",
      "t": 42,
      "localT": 1,
      "text": "Above a desert world at the ragged edge of the map, the chase runs out of room.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/chase_00.mp3",
      "dur": 5.01551
    },
    {
      "id": "chase_01",
      "scene": "chase",
      "t": 49,
      "localT": 8,
      "text": "The corvette is fast. It is not fast enough.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/chase_01.mp3",
      "dur": 3.657143
    },
    {
      "id": "chase_02",
      "scene": "chase",
      "t": 54.5,
      "localT": 13.5,
      "text": "Out of the dark comes two kilometres of grey wedge and turbolaser.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/chase_02.mp3",
      "dur": 4.728163
    },
    {
      "id": "chase_03",
      "scene": "chase",
      "t": 62,
      "localT": 21,
      "text": "Ion fire rakes the little ship, and her engines die one by one.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/chase_03.mp3",
      "dur": 4.858776
    },
    {
      "id": "boarding_00",
      "scene": "boarding",
      "t": 72,
      "localT": 1,
      "text": "They breach at the forward corridor.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/boarding_00.mp3",
      "dur": 2.481633
    },
    {
      "id": "boarding_01",
      "scene": "boarding",
      "t": 76,
      "localT": 5,
      "text": "Rebel troopers hold the line for eleven seconds.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/boarding_01.mp3",
      "dur": 3.683265
    },
    {
      "id": "boarding_02",
      "scene": "boarding",
      "t": 83.5,
      "localT": 12.5,
      "text": "Then the smoke parts.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/boarding_02.mp3",
      "dur": 1.750204
    },
    {
      "id": "boarding_03",
      "scene": "boarding",
      "t": 91,
      "localT": 20,
      "text": "Where are the transmissions you intercepted?",
      "voice": "vader",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/boarding_03.mp3",
      "dur": 2.533878
    },
    {
      "id": "boarding_04",
      "scene": "boarding",
      "t": 96.5,
      "localT": 25.5,
      "text": "Everyone aboard knows that sound. Nobody wants to be the one who answers.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/boarding_04.mp3",
      "dur": 5.511837
    },
    {
      "id": "pod_00",
      "scene": "pod",
      "t": 104.8,
      "localT": 0.8,
      "text": "The princess had already made her choice.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/pod_00.mp3",
      "dur": 2.847347
    },
    {
      "id": "pod_01",
      "scene": "pod",
      "t": 109,
      "localT": 5,
      "text": "She hides the plans inside an astromech, and sends him down the corridor with a protocol droid who has never once been told the plan.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/pod_01.mp3",
      "dur": 8.306939
    },
    {
      "id": "pod_02",
      "scene": "pod",
      "t": 119,
      "localT": 15,
      "text": "Escape pod seven jettisons at a quarter past the hour.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/pod_02.mp3",
      "dur": 3.996735
    },
    {
      "id": "pod_03",
      "scene": "pod",
      "t": 125.5,
      "localT": 21.5,
      "text": "Hold your fire. No life forms aboard.",
      "voice": "imperial",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/pod_03.mp3",
      "dur": 2.899592
    },
    {
      "id": "tatooine_00",
      "scene": "tatooine",
      "t": 132.5,
      "localT": 1.5,
      "text": "Tatooine. Twin suns, no shade, and eleven thousand kilometres of nothing.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/tatooine_00.mp3",
      "dur": 5.955918
    },
    {
      "id": "tatooine_01",
      "scene": "tatooine",
      "t": 140.5,
      "localT": 9.5,
      "text": "Two droids walk away from the only argument they will ever win.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/tatooine_01.mp3",
      "dur": 4.231837
    },
    {
      "id": "tatooine_02",
      "scene": "tatooine",
      "t": 148,
      "localT": 17,
      "text": "By evening a sandcrawler finds them, because on this planet everything is eventually found, and sold.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/tatooine_02.mp3",
      "dur": 7.183673
    },
    {
      "id": "tatooine_03",
      "scene": "tatooine",
      "t": 157,
      "localT": 26,
      "text": "The plans keep travelling. That is all the plans have to do.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/tatooine_03.mp3",
      "dur": 4.231837
    },
    {
      "id": "trench_00",
      "scene": "trench",
      "t": 163.8,
      "localT": 0.8,
      "text": "The rest, you know.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/trench_00.mp3",
      "dur": 1.697959
    },
    {
      "id": "trench_01",
      "scene": "trench",
      "t": 166.5,
      "localT": 3.5,
      "text": "A farm boy. A smuggler. A very old man with a very old sword.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/trench_01.mp3",
      "dur": 5.720816
    },
    {
      "id": "trench_02",
      "scene": "trench",
      "t": 173,
      "localT": 10,
      "text": "And thirty pilots against a moon.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/trench_02.mp3",
      "dur": 2.429388
    },
    {
      "id": "trench_03",
      "scene": "trench",
      "t": 178,
      "localT": 15,
      "text": "Red Five, standing by.",
      "voice": "comm",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/trench_03.mp3",
      "dur": 1.750204
    },
    {
      "id": "trench_04",
      "scene": "trench",
      "t": 182,
      "localT": 19,
      "text": "The trench is twelve metres wide and entirely full of guns.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/trench_04.mp3",
      "dur": 4.310204
    },
    {
      "id": "trench_05",
      "scene": "trench",
      "t": 190,
      "localT": 27,
      "text": "The targeting computer says the shot is impossible.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/trench_05.mp3",
      "dur": 3.291429
    },
    {
      "id": "trench_06",
      "scene": "trench",
      "t": 196,
      "localT": 33,
      "text": "So he switches it off.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/trench_06.mp3",
      "dur": 2.037551
    },
    {
      "id": "trench_07",
      "scene": "trench",
      "t": 202.5,
      "localT": 39.5,
      "text": "Torpedoes away!",
      "voice": "comm",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/trench_07.mp3",
      "dur": 1.018776
    },
    {
      "id": "finale_00",
      "scene": "finale",
      "t": 212,
      "localT": 3,
      "text": "One pilot, two torpedoes, and a very expensive lesson in exhaust port design.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/finale_00.mp3",
      "dur": 6.164898
    },
    {
      "id": "finale_01",
      "scene": "finale",
      "t": 220,
      "localT": 11,
      "text": "The Empire built a machine that could kill a planet.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/finale_01.mp3",
      "dur": 3.369796
    },
    {
      "id": "finale_02",
      "scene": "finale",
      "t": 225.5,
      "localT": 16.5,
      "text": "The rebellion built something that could not be shot down.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/finale_02.mp3",
      "dur": 3.474286
    },
    {
      "id": "finale_03",
      "scene": "finale",
      "t": 231,
      "localT": 22,
      "text": "Every brick, ship, star and note in this film was written by a machine that has never seen a film.",
      "voice": "narrator",
      "gain": 1,
      "file": "vo/finale_03.mp3",
      "dur": 6.19102
    }
  ]
}